@startuml F5.11-D02-ELEGIVEIS-buscar
title F5.11-D02-ELEGIVEIS — Buscar elegíveis para colação
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true
skinparam maxMessageSize 220
autonumber

actor "Secretaria" as Sec
participant "WebApp" as WebApp
participant "JwtFilter" as Jwt
participant "GraduationController" as Ctrl
database "Postgres" as Postgres

Sec -> WebApp: curso e período
WebApp -> Jwt: GET /diplomas/elegiveis
Jwt -> Ctrl: JWT ok
Ctrl -> Postgres: avaliar 5 critérios
note right of Ctrl
  TCC, disciplinas, horas,
  financeiro, solicitações
end note
Postgres --> Ctrl: eligible + bloqueio
Ctrl --> WebApp: 200 lista
WebApp --> Sec: checkboxes + tooltips

@enduml
